41450::$$$message_0299_0000_0000$$$::"Dark Saber (Left). This would be more like her default state, when the blood vessel-like patterns aren't visible.[br][cacheimage storage=アーチャー神主01h(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=アーチャー神主01h(中)]On the other hand... Uhh..."::
41451::$$$message_0299_0001_0000$$$::"Goth loli. Gothic lolita."::
41452::$$$message_0299_0002_0000$$$::"...Hm, yes. I was trying to figure out if there was another way to say it."::
41453::$$$message_0299_0003_0000$$$::"Resistance is futile. It's good to be hot and bothered."::
41454::$$$message_0299_0004_0000$$$::"Now, let's see... 'Her appearance and skin tone make her seem like a doll, or a corpse. We actually had a date scene in mind for Dark Saber.'[wvl canskip=0 time=400] ...Says the character artist."[skip_next_tag len=2][br]::
41455::$$$message_0299_0005_0000$$$::"Not more[br][cacheimage storage=凛巫女服01i(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛巫女服01i(中)][shock vmax=20 time=400 count=7] hopeless dreaming!"::

